# Skips the devShell when tectonic is already global (dots-managed
# machines) and provisions it via nix otherwise (bare machines).
#
# If you populate `extraTexFiles` in flake.nix, switch this to a plain
# `use flake` instead — the skip below would also skip the shellHook that
# stages those files, silently leaving them missing even though tectonic
# itself is present.
if ! command -v tectonic &> /dev/null; then
  use flake
fi
